share-lead = Idan Katna ta faɗi, tana ajiye rahoto a wannan kwamfuta. Aika waɗannan rahotanni yana taimakawa a gyara abin da ya lalace. Kuna iya canza wannan a kowane lokaci a Saituna > Ra'ayin mai amfani.
